flowchart LR
    subgraph pr [Pull request]
        open([Open PR]) --> lint[Lint]
        open --> unit[Unit tests]
        lint --> review{Review}
        unit --> review
    end
    subgraph main [Main branch]
        merge[Merge] --> build[Build] --> publish[(Publish package)]
    end
    review -->|approved| merge
    review -->|changes requested| open
